---
const steps = [
  ['Open the insight','Move from the Insights summary into the high-traffic spike caused by Elephant Flows.'],
  ['Review the proposal','Read the agent’s recommended steps before allowing it to touch the network.'],
  ['Assign the job','Turn the recommendation into a named, scoped job with an ID, owner and visible status.'],
  ['Supervise execution','Follow classification, bypass rules, throttling and validation as the agent completes each step.'],
  ['Inspect the evidence','Review the timeline, generated artifacts, metrics and report before accepting completion.'],
  ['Return with status','Move back to the original insight and see whether the remediation is still running or complete.'],
];
const evidence = [
  ['Explicit scope','The insight, impacted device, applications and operational goal travel into the job.'],
  ['Proposed plan','Every remediation step is visible before assignment—not revealed after the agent starts.'],
  ['Live progress','The job page distinguishes what is complete, in progress and still waiting.'],
  ['Evidence per step','Agent reasoning, success criteria, generated configurations and validation remain inspectable.'],
  ['Recoverable output','The operator can view metrics, download evidence and share the final report.'],
];
---

<div class="assign-journey">
  <header class="assign-hero">
    <a href="/work/agenticops#agentic-trust">← Back to Trust journey</a>
    <p>Journey 02 · Assign a job from Insights</p>
    <h1>Turn one understood insight into a supervised agent job.</h1>
    <div><p>The corrected journey follows the work after diagnosis: review the proposed remediation, assign it with clear boundaries, watch the agent execute, inspect the evidence and return to an insight whose status now means something.</p><aside>Phase 02 · AgenticOps<br/><b>Permission, progress, proof</b></aside></div>
  </header>

  <nav aria-label="Assign-job journey chapters"><a href="#flow">Journey flow</a><a href="#evidence">Decision evidence</a><a href="#artifact">Figma artifact</a><a href="#handoff">Handoff</a></nav>

  <section id="flow" class="assign-section">
    <p class="index">01 / Journey flow</p><h2>Six moves from “this looks serious” to “the job is complete—and here is the proof.”</h2>
    <div class="step-grid">{steps.map(([title,copy],index) => <article><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div>
  </section>

  <section id="evidence" class="assign-section dark-section">
    <p class="index">02 / Decision evidence</p><h2>The interface earns action by showing its work.</h2>
    <p class="lead">The operator never has to donate blind faith to the agent. Scope, plan, progress, generated evidence and final status stay visible from assignment through completion.</p>
    <div class="evidence-list">{evidence.map(([title,copy],index) => <article><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>{title}</strong><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div>
    <aside>The agent may do the work. The operator still gets the receipts.</aside>
  </section>

  <section id="artifact" class="assign-section artifact-section">
    <p class="index">03 / Complete Figma artifact</p><h2>The corrected assignment flow, preserved exactly as designed.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Scroll from the original insight through proposed remediation, job setup, supervised execution, completion evidence, report sharing and the final insight status.</p>
    <figure><img src="/images/agentic-journeys/agentic-assign-job-flow-2025-4.png" alt="Complete AgenticOps journey for assigning an insight to an agent, supervising remediation, reviewing evidence and returning to the updated insight" loading="eager" /><figcaption><span>2025-4 · Journey artifact</span><p>Exact export from the corrected Figma artboard. No interface screens were reconstructed or altered.</p></figcaption></figure>
  </section>

  <section id="handoff" class="assign-section handoff-section">
    <p class="index">04 / Handoff and return</p><h2>The agent receives a bounded job. The operator receives progress, evidence and closure.</h2>
    <div class="handoff-flow"><article><span>Permission</span><b>Approve a visible remediation plan for one understood insight</b></article><i>→</i><article><span>Supervision</span><b>Track every step, decision, artifact and validation result</b></article><i>→</i><article><span>Closure</span><b>Share the report and return to an insight marked in progress or complete</b></article></div>
    <div class="journey-footer"><a href="/work/agenticops/journeys/insight-page">← Previous · Insight page</a><a href="/work/agenticops#agentic-trust">All journeys</a><a href="/work/agenticops/journeys/bulk-assign-insights">Next · Bulk assignment →</a></div>
  </section>
</div>

